      "message": "If the advertiser was removed from any of the requests, it is removed from mAllAdvertisers\n\nBut possibly it remains in some of the requests; so it shouldn\u0027t be removed ?\n\nFor example,\n - AdvertiserRequest A has a pending registration and uses the advertiser\n - AdvertiserRequest B has no pending registration and uses the advertiser\n \n--\u003e The advertiser is removed from B but not from A\n--\u003e The advertiser is removed from mAllAdvertisers, even though it is still in A\n\nIf you implement the comment in MdnsInterfaceAdvertiser, the advertiser should always be destroyed when destroyAdvertiser is called (since mPendingRegistrations should be guaranteed to be empty), so you could remove from mAllAdvertisers inconditionally",
